{"t":"Flour","s":"flour-c3f1a","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Flour_e828c3.gif","q":6,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Flour</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Flour\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flour_e828c3.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Plants, Animal Products, Food and Drink<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Negotiable</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">30 gp</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">January 07, 1997<br/>Alpha 1.0</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20210713214407&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flour_e828c3.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  flour.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 1.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Use a <a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\">scythe</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Scythe\"><img alt=\"Scythe\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scythe_80bc24.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> to cut <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat\">wheat</a> to get <a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\">bunches of wheat</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bunch%20of%20Wheat\"><img alt=\"Bunch of Wheat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bunch_of_Wheat_392881.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> from a <a href=\"#/wiki/Wheat%20Field\">wheat field</a>, grind it to flour <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Flour\"><img alt=\"Flour\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flour_e828c3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> in a <a href=\"#/wiki/Millstone\">millstone</a>.<br/>\nAlso used in the process of making <a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">bread</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Cake\">cakes</a>, use it with water from a trough or <a href=\"#/wiki/Bucket\">bucket</a> to turn it into a Lump of Dough and mix with <a href=\"#/wiki/Milk\">milk</a> to make a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lump%20of%20Cake%20Dough\">Lump of Cake Dough</a>.\n</p><p>For those with no skill at farming a trip to the pirate kitchen in the upper reaches of <a href=\"#/wiki/Nargor\">Nargor</a> will yield both flour and lumps of dough. You can also find more than 594 flour in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dream%20Realm\">Dream Realm</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32845,32235,14\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32845, 32235, 14)</a> close to <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Dream%20Master\">The Dream Master</a>.<br/>It looks the same as <a href=\"#/wiki/Fungus%20Powder\">Fungus Powder</a> and Sugar.\n1 of these is needed in <a href=\"#/quest/the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest\">The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest</a>.<br/>\n24 of these are needed in the <a href=\"#/quest/what-a-foolish-quest\">What a foolish Quest</a>.<br/>\n15 are needed in the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.<br/>\n2 are needed in the <a href=\"#/quest/blood-brothers-quest\">Blood Brothers Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>The weight was changed from 5.00 oz to 1.00 oz on the Update 8.5.<br/>\nIt happened basically to avoid confusion with how many units of flour are needed in <a href=\"#/quest/the-scatterbrained-sorcerer-quest\">The Scatterbrained Sorcerer Quest</a> and because flour is actually really light and shouldn't weigh as much as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fish\">fish</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"w-cite_ref-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"w-cite_note-1\"><b>^</b> <span class=\"reference-text\">Chayenne, <i>Known and fixed Content Bugs</i> thread of <i>Private - Test Board</i>, June 29th, 2009.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Goggle%20Cake\">Goggle Cake</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buyfrom\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th>NPC</th><th>Location</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Larek\">Larek</a></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Krailos\">Krailos</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">30 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">